// The occurs check, end to end.
//
// `x` is unannotated, so it takes a fresh type variable. Inferring the body `x(x)` hits the
// `Var`-callee branch of `apply_arguments`, which constrains the callee to `Fn(arg, fresh)` —
// and here the argument *is* the callee, so the constraint is `_0 := Fn(_0, _1)`: a type that
// contains itself.
//
// `union_with_concrete_type` must reject the binding rather than write the cycle into the map,
// where it would make `subsitute` recurse forever. Should fail analysis with `InfiniteType`.

let selfApply = (x) => x(x)
